  "sources": "Each source is a Civ VI Resources.artdef entry, imported by tools/asset_compiler/resource_composition_sources.py. decal_source borrows another entry's ground decals; accent_source adds that entry's centre model. accent_scale places the source's centre model (Civ VI's authored pile), or accent_source's, at the first cluster's centre; 0 disables it.",
